{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e17c8c924b4c6899c1ab8bbdde4cd84fcf8a4d3773006a672496946ef68fea68",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60f3a9f8d48307e6fe8e76de1fefcbaca9333cfd8d4fe91392da672164cacf6c",
      "text": "W到达折返点了。在这里，\n将要挑战‘搭档默契问答’！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ece90cedb36ca5dd8b1099722c25cde27a72d12f04dd6ee6637c6a11caccf29",
      "text": "这个对我们来说也很简单吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16ae8032b9a7a3bd3218ed681a019f629aa5152e6d874182f776b281121d4aab",
      "text": "没毛病。轻轻松松全问答对给他们看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:401d30c3e7d63d78b2784f5430626ab37f6fac3df9218e27ffcf62d65daea99a",
      "text": "……回答正确！不愧是W，不愧是双胞胎，\n再次给出了完全一致的答案！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a58d954fb8d9ea4ff684877f751ebfa8c76b13cabef3d8ac4c9f49a4cb88248f",
      "text": "嘿嘿，那是当然♪\n下一题也会完美答出来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25a0168ffbb103f59713f8dbafb1f485fb23599a2c34b6573916775554e2630e",
      "text": "那么……第4题！\n苍井享介讨厌的食物是！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19ed6e55192c571414ee3d7b7261132cf6a9f39b4488c76b9180f13947e1f2da",
      "text": "好——！青椒！……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f00e23c1eeb71c97e135566da9a99b3504ddc92aa01f1e95d601e8696f105e0",
      "text": "……悠介，那是你自己讨厌的吧……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:201881cc0223fafa094707306958b04d943a57dca0b51116433a9aa84add279b",
      "text": "抱、抱歉，搞错了！\n刚才那次不算……不行，是吧……可恶——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09768302aafb2f3d31bd487815fa938158596a2523f9ee12f85fef2c8a35d6a2",
      "text": "（搞什么啊，明明应该全对的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1ebcc23f8b40ca67ecc9bfa90a902d2eb94ea5f242691b3ed0b78035bfa3c7c",
      "text": "那么，第6题！苍井悠介害怕的东西是！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cc073b242dcf1a75f6ca649f47fd946f39663cc99e23a67f558831d2587788d",
      "text": "是幽灵哦。悠介胆子真的很小。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f67bc3506d92b333340dec4d45638304459996cbf74beeccefc208125280e1d",
      "text": "前阵子电视上播恐怖片预告的时候，\n他还被吓了一大跳呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d9c4e9fa41233daba1515e6c9b9a37ed487c9f7d174ad24fd780f5c94198db4",
      "text": "享介明明到现在还超害怕看牙医好不好！\n每次去的时候都吓得不行——。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b4f7f671383743d323d0095f001126ddadd69119bc89639c35c43c1358c3ab6",
      "text": "什……这没必要说出来吧。\n现在问的是悠介害怕的东西啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b34d73c1cdcedf77b4bb6263d90376727fa6adcc8ae7b248389adcb0449e4d71",
      "text": "先多嘴的人明明是享介你吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bb777f41ea8d3e5818e1d5399997d7157bd46d8b4ec154f1dfbafe803215d57",
      "text": "那个……咳咳！那么，请听下一题！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
